5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's find that werewolf quickly. I'm not letting anyone here get hurt!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, young Takumi. Let us observe each other with kindness and clarity. The truth reveals itself in time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help us find the right answer together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I will be observing. Let's see how everyone behaves.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Toshio. We should analyze the patterns of speech and logic before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't have time for ""observing"" if it means waiting for someone to get eaten! We need a plan.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,A plan born of haste is often flawed. Let us listen to the silence between the words.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,Maybe we can start by sharing our thoughts on how we should approach the voting tomorrow?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Midori's suggestion is reasonable. A structured approach reduces the risk of emotional errors.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji, you sound too robotic. Are you trying to hide something behind all that logic?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Now, now. Logic is a tool, not a mask. Let us be gentle with one another.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,I think Ryuji is just being careful. We should try to stay harmonious so we can trust each other.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, your aggression is a bit premature. It makes it harder to assess the situation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am simply assessing the variables. Aggression is an inefficient way to identify a werewolf.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being aggressive, I'm being proactive! I'll find the wolf even if I have to do it alone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Solitude is a heavy burden, Takumi. We are a community; let us lean on each other's strengths.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. Let's all try to get some rest and think clearly for tomorrow.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
