31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I've got a lead. I'm feeling confident about who's human, but we still need to be careful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Servas,,The morning light brings new perspectives. I hope everyone slept peacefully.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Midori,,Good morning. I hope we can make a fair decision today without any fighting.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"If the Seer has information, now is the time to consider how to use it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Indeed. If a Seer exists, their divination is the only objective fact we have.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, @Ryuji, you two are always talking about ""facts"" and ""information."" It's suspicious.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Curiosity is a virtue, Takumi. Do not mistake a desire for truth for a desire to deceive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,I feel like we're starting to divide. Can't we try to find common ground first?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, your suspicion is based on personality, not evidence. That is a dangerous way to vote.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Toshio. To vote based on a ""feeling"" of suspicion is logically unsound.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Logic can be a lie! I trust my gut. I think one of you is the Possessed, helping the wolf.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"The heart and the mind must walk hand in hand. Trust your gut, but verify with your soul.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that if we keep arguing, the werewolf will just laugh at us. Let's be careful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori is right. We are wasting time. If no one is coming forward as Seer, we must analyze the behavior.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If the Seer remains hidden to avoid being attacked, we must look for inconsistencies in the claims.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not hiding, I'm just testing you! But I've seen enough. I'm voting for the one who's too quiet.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,Silence is often where the deepest wisdom resides. Let us not punish the quiet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I don't want to point fingers, but maybe we should look at who is pushing the most?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will vote based on who seems most likely to be manipulating the flow of this conversation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will cast my vote based on the most probable candidate for the werewolf role.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
