63,2,1,talk,Servas,,A sad day indeed. Takumi's passion was a fire that burned too bright. May he find peace.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,2,1,talk,Midori,,It's so sad... I really didn't want us to execute someone so early. I hope we got it right.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Takumi was too erratic. His removal stabilizes the discussion, but we lost a voice.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Loss is a teacher, my friends. It teaches us the value of the time we have left.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, do you think the werewolf is still among us? I mean, obviously they are, but do you have a lead?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The werewolf likely targeted Ryuji to remove a logical anchor. That suggests the wolf fears a calculated approach.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,3,talk,Servas,,Fear is a powerful motivator. The wolf hides in the shadows of our own doubts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Midori,,I'm scared... what if we vote out another innocent person? We have to be absolutely sure.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"We cannot be ""absolutely sure"" without a Seer's confirmation. @Servas, you've been very vague.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
