73,2,4,talk,Midori,,I trust Servas. He's been so kind to all of us from the start.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"Kindness can be a very effective mask for a predator. I'm watching you, Servas.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
